      "sentence_id": 14,
      "text": "Prosecution case in brief is that on 16.9.2022 at 5 pm mother of the prosecutrix lodged a report against present applicant /accused alleging that before 15 days she along with her husband had gone to Mungawali for doing labour and due to excessive rain, yesterday they could not return to their village and stayed at Chanderi at sister's house.",
