      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.20026497542858124
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 17,
      "text": "When she enquired from her both the daughters, then her elder daughter informed that in the night when both the sisters were alone in the house, applicant came at their house and firstly molested her and thereafter committed rape with her younger sister.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 1961,
      "end": 2215,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": true,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.3063335716724396
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 18,
      "text": "When the complainant asked from the younger daughter, then she also corroborated the version of his elder sister.",
      "rhetorical_role": "FAC",
      "start": 2216,
      "end": 2329,
      "entities": [],
      "in_summary": false,
      "summary_section": "facts",
      "summary_sent_score": 0.27135658264160156
    },
    {
      "sentence_id": 19,
      "text": "She further stated that applicant also threatened her to face dire consequences.",
